Users of the Database

Relationship Managers — access authorised corporate customer and account information.

Bank Tellers and Operations Officers — process and verify deposits, withdrawals, and transfers.

Branch Operations Managers — monitor account activity, transaction volumes, and exceptions.

Database Administrators — manage database availability, performance, backups, and recovery.

Internal Control and Information Security Officers — review audit trails, access permissions, and suspicious transaction patterns.

Reporting and Management Teams — analyse deposit volumes, withdrawals, transaction trends, and corporate customer activity.
